OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who says 999 call foiled
OL,4,ARAF Fairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FA farmer who called 999 when she saw "a
OL,8,Flarge group of hooded and masked men"
OL,9,Fnear RAF Fairford early on Sunday
OL,10,Fmorning believes she "foiled" their
OL,11,Fplans
OL,13,FShe tells the Today programme she was
OL,14,Fcoming home from a party when a road
OL,15,Fwas blocked by "three white vans". She
OL,16,Fthen saw the group of men run off
OL,18,FShe says she called 999 at 01:36 BST:
OL,19,F"I think it was pure luck that I
OL,20,Farrived in the village at a similar
OL,21,Ftime to the vans"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
