OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who says 999 call foiled
OL,4,ARAF Fairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,8,Fsays she only has a "partial picture",
OL,9,Fwhile declining to speculate on
OL,10,Fpossible Iranian links. Here's Frank
OL,11,FGardner's analysis
OL,13,FGloucestershire Police say they were
OL,14,Falerted at about 00:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FFive men remain in custody - they were
OL,16,Farrested under the Explosives Act and
OL,17,Fon suspicion of preparing a terrorist
OL,18,Fact
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
