OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who says 999 call foiled
OL,4,ARAF Fairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe RAF base, in the Cotswolds, is used
OL,8,Fby the US military. President Trump
OL,9,Fsays the US had the five men "under
OL,10,Fview for a long time, and we got them"
